### Stage map
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/venues
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/contract-types
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/bookings
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/concerts

### Create venue
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/venues
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "wave-a-stage",
  "name": "Wave A Stage",
  "city": "CDMX",
  "countryCode": "MEX",
  "capacity": 120,
  "suggestedTicketUsdc": 15.00,
  "latitude": 19.4326000,
  "longitude": -99.1332000,
  "pinStatus": "active",
  "contractTypeId": 1
}

###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "venueId": 1,
  "bandId": 1,
  "showDate": "2026-10-01",
  "pipelineWeek": 2,
  "status": "booked"
}

###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/concerts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": 2,
  "venueId": 1,
  "bandId": 1,
  "sppCycleId": 1,
  "status": "scheduled"
}

### Settle Bar La Cueva (gross 875, expenses 200)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/concerts/1/settle
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "grossUsdc": 875.00
}

###
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/settlements/1/claims

###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/pending-claims/1/claim
